+| `ASHMEM_RELEASE_OFF` | `ashmem_release` | `0x00d39940` |
+| `ASHMEM_SHOW_FDINFO_OFF` | `ashmem_show_fdinfo` | `0x00d39a60` |
+| `ANON_PIPE_BUF_OPS_OFF` | `anon_pipe_buf_ops` | `0x0121dd10` |
+| `ASHMEM_FOPS_OFF` | `ashmem_fops` | `0x013d9ec8` |
